The derivations are not all of the same kind, and the difference matters to
anyone reading the diff:

  – `canvas-design`, `doc-coauthoring` and `web-artifacts-builder` are
    reproduced essentially verbatim. Each gains one short added section
    (a Claude Code rendering note, a tool-mapping note, a Node/runtime
    requirements note) and nothing is removed. The bundled
    `web-artifacts-builder/scripts/` — `init-artifact.sh`,
    `bundle-artifact.sh`, `shadcn-components.tar.gz` — and every file under
    `canvas-design/canvas-fonts/` are byte-for-byte the originals.

  – `figure-style` is close to verbatim: the checklist is the original's, and
    the kernel differs only in host-call replacement and static-checker
    accommodations.

  – `literature-review`, `pdf-explore`, `figure-composer` and `paper-narrative`
    are substantial adaptations. Claude Science kernels run inside a host that
    injects them and exposes an in-process model, artifact store and credential
    vault through a `host.*` SDK. None of that exists in stock Claude Code, so
    every such dependency was replaced: `host.llm` became prompt-builder
    functions the agent feeds to itself or to `Task` subagents (with the
    original's single blocking call re-shaped into an explicit
    PREPARE → fan-out → ASSEMBLE protocol), `host.view_image` became
    save-crop-then-`Read`, `save_artifacts` became `Write`, artifact ids became
    filesystem paths, and stored credentials became environment variables.
    `literature-review` was additionally generalised from a bio-leaning to an
    all-STEM scope and extended with a resolve-published → dedupe → BibTeX
    export path; `pdf-explore` was extended with deterministic table extraction
    and embedded-figure extraction. These extensions are original work.

  • The `computational-scientist` agent is a distillation, not a copy: it
    restates working-style principles from the Claude Science OPERON agent
    persona (produce artifacts, compute-don't-confabulate, read-the-docs-first,
    ground capability claims in the environment, economy of steps, lab-notebook
    register) in this marketplace's own words and against Claude Code's tools.
    No text is reproduced from the original.

  • The `deep-researcher` agent is original work and derives from no external
    source.

